<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - National Steel raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - National Steel raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan Securities said analyst Michael Gambardella upgraded National Steel Corp to buy from market performer.</p>
<p>-- Said believes the company will have a significant increase in cash generation potential from recent and expected asset sales and internal cash flow.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/4 to 8-5/8.</p>
</text>
